  "title": "Glass Tube Gauges",
  "description": "Five rounded glass tubes tilt up into place one after another, then fill with liquid that overshoots and settles with an elastic bounce, a bright meniscus riding the surface and a number counting up beneath each; afterwards the tubes bob gently.",
